From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Longwei Yang <19267252+Longwei-Yang@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:41:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Safarium: checkpoint of native UI work through 2026-11-17
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Snapshot of all uncommitted Safarium work in this tree, combining the
Claude Code "safarium构建" session and the Codex "继续改进 Safarium 构建"
thread:

- Native NSToolbar with custom Compact tab bar item (tab pills, address
  bar editing, drag reorder, animated add/close), tab overview grid with
  zoom transitions
- Address-bar page menu, native downloads popover, per-extension
  toolbar items
- Safarium branding: Safarium.app, org.safarium.app, own data dir and
  keychain item, About/version/credits pages, app icon
- Native UI enabled by default

Local checkpoint only; not intended for upstream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
